    "先查看上方状态：等待授权时，在后台活动区域查找 Adobe Downloader 或其开发者条目；可点信息按钮核对 App 路径。尚未注册时先点击启用；文件、签名或注册错误需先修复。手动加入“登录时打开”列表和授予完全磁盘访问都不能替代后台服务授权。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check the status above first. If approval is required, look for Adobe Downloader or its developer under background activity; use the info button to check the app path. If unregistered, click Enable Helper. Resolve file, signature, or registration errors first. Adding the app to Open at Login or granting Full Disk Access does not approve its background service."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先查看上方状态：等待授权时，在后台活动区域查找 Adobe Downloader 或其开发者条目；可点信息按钮核对 App 路径。尚未注册时先点击启用；文件、签名或注册错误需先修复。手动加入“登录时打开”列表和授予完全磁盘访问都不能替代后台服务授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
