            "value" : "请保留此目录，以便检查和恢复未完成的卸载操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在 Helper 设置查看具体状态。尚未注册时点击「启用 Helper」；等待授权时点击「打开后台项目」，在系统设置 → 通用 → 登录项与扩展的后台活动区域允许 Adobe Downloader。返回 App 后自动检查，无需重启。列表中没有条目时，请检查文件、签名或注册错误，并复制诊断信息。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check the detailed status in Helper settings. If unregistered, click Enable Helper. If approval is required, click Open background items and allow Adobe Downloader under System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions → background activity. Return to the app for an automatic check; no restart is needed. If the entry is missing, check for file, signature, or registration errors and copy the diagnostics."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先在 Helper 设置查看具体状态。尚未注册时点击「启用 Helper」；等待授权时点击「打开后台项目」，在系统设置 → 通用 → 登录项与扩展的后台活动区域允许 Adobe Downloader。返回 App 后自动检查，无需重启。列表中没有条目时，请检查文件、签名或注册错误，并复制诊断信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先结束正在进行的安装或清理。迁移需要管理员授权，会停止旧服务，将以下文件移存至 /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/AdobeDownloaderHelperBackup.*，然后注册当前版本。原文件保留，可按备份路径恢复。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finish any installation or cleanup first. Migration requires administrator approval. It stops the old service, moves the files below to /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/AdobeDownloaderHelperBackup.*, and registers the current version. Original files remain in the backup for recovery."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先结束正在进行的安装或清理。迁移需要管理员授权，会停止旧服务，将以下文件移存至 /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/AdobeDownloaderHelperBackup.*，然后注册当前版本。原文件保留，可按备份路径恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在下载管理器中查看进度" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Please check the progress in the download manager"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在下载管理器中查看进度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请按以下步骤处理：\n1. 在 Helper 设置中点击「重新启用」\n2. 前往系统设置 → 登录项与扩展\n3. 找到 Adobe Downloader.app 并打开开关\n4. 重启 Adobe Downloader\n5. 再次点击「重新启用」或「重新连接」" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Follow these steps:\n1. Click \"Re-enable\" in Helper Settings\n2. Go to System Settings → Login Items & Extensions\n3. Find Adobe Downloader.app and turn it on\n4. Restart Adobe Downloader\n5. Click \"Re-enable\" or \"Reconnect\" again"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请按以下步骤处理：\n1. 在 Helper 设置中点击「重新启用」\n2. 前往系统设置 → 登录项与扩展\n3. 找到 Adobe Downloader.app 并打开开关\n4. 重启 Adobe Downloader\n5. 再次点击「重新启用」或「重新连接」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
